    "8",
    "Fundraiser",
    "Wealth brings wealth, and to",
    "this estate’s noble destitute",
    "family this was only but a",
    "saying. However, the owner was adamant",
    "that various riches could be found in the",
    "ruins: “Venture through the ruins and",
    "take back what was ours! Bring wealth",
    "and glory back to our noble family!”",
    "SPECIAL RULES",
    "One Lair Room must be cleared",
    "as the minimum Quest goal.",
    "Clearing Lairs awards 10 {icon:fb419f48c4} .",
